  "notes_for_editor": "Two sources only: a short firelookout.com entry and one row of the FFLA list. The entry has no builder, staffing or fire history. The 'Flathead Indian Reservation' line is a land label on the entry, not a county, and the FFLA row does not confirm it, so the land status is unverified and the story says so. Searches for Schly and Schly plus Flathead found nothing more. 'Schley Mountain' (us-mt-schley-mountain, Mineral County) is a different lookout and must not be merged. The 50 ft height is converted to 15.24 m.",
